@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #43546B
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title Intelligent CRM Platform\nProposed component architecture
top to bottom direction
component "Web UI\nVue 3 / TypeScript\nBeybit" as UI
component "CRM API\nFastAPI / Python\nDanial\nSession, role and ownership checks\nImport, jobs, reviews, export" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nCustomers, turns, jobs, runs,\nreviews and audit" as DB
component "Analysis worker\nPython / Akhmediyar\nLease committed jobs, method adapter,\noutput validation" as Worker
artifact "Pinned local model\nor deterministic baseline" as Model
cloud "Optional hosted model\nDisabled by default" as Hosted
UI -down-> API : HTTP JSON\nSubmit job / poll job status
API -down-> DB : Commit queued job\nbefore HTTP 202;\nread authorised status / result
Worker -up-> DB : Lease committed jobs;\nstore state and immutable runs
Worker -down-> Model : local inference
Worker .down.> Hosted : optional permitted inference
note bottom of Worker
Validate schema and source references.
Bound retries; retain source/config versions.
end note
@enduml
